            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang ditampilkan kode ini di konsol?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_grades = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;F&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" student_grades:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"F\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A+\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A-\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"C\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>F</code>, <code>A+</code>, <code>A-</code>, dan terakhir <code>C</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kode ini tidak akan menampilkan apa pun di console</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>grade</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>F</code>, <code>A+</code>, <code>A-</code>, dan terakhir <code>C</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Baris berindentasi mana yang akan membuat loop ini menampilkan seluruh list <code>student_grades</code> sebanyak empat kali?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"student_grades = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;F&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A+&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;A-&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;C&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" grade \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" student_grades:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(grade)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"F\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A+\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"A-\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"C\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>print(student_grades)</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(grade)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"student_grades\")</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>print(student_grades)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
