            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Karin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(user)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for</code> digunakan dua kali</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah dengan kode ini</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ada <code>:</code> yang hilang</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>for</code> digunakan dua kali.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pengganti header loop mana yang membuat kode menampilkan setiap pengguna?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Karin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Anna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" user \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" users:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(user)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for user in users:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for user for users:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in user for users:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for user in users:</code>.</p></body></html>",
